    <bf:summary>
      <bf:Summary>
	<rdfs:label>"Step into the scenes of Sarah's life with Debbie Salter Goodwin's creative retellings of key moments like: her famous journey into the wilderness with Abraham; Sarah's experience as part of two different kings' harems; her attempts to bring God's promise to fruition through the use and abuse of Hagar; the birth of Isaac, and more. Sarah: Unchosen Journeys helps us explore what God might want to teach us today through the lens of a strong, flawed woman who was doing the best she could while trying to understand the cryptic leading of God in her life"-- Provided by publisher.</rdfs:label>
      </bf:Summary>
    </bf:summary>
